*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Epson TM-T20III - open CUPS driver (rastertotmt20)
*% Command set reverse-engineered from Epson APD6; see RE_NOTES.md.
*% Option groups follow the Windows driver: Paper/Quality, Advanced,
*% Feed and Cut, Peripherals.  Detail settings (per-timing feed/cut,
*% peripherals, Send Command, margins, user defined paper) are written into
*% the queue's copy of this file by TMUtility.app > Printing Preferences as
*% "*TmSetting" / "*TmUserPaper" lines at the @@ markers below.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.2.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "TMT20III.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Epson"
*Product: "(TM-T20III)"
*ModelName: "Epson TM-T20III"
*ShortNickName: "Epson TM-T20III"
*NickName: "Epson TM-T20III (rastertotmt20)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:EPSON;MDL:TM-T20III;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/Epson/TMT20III/rastertotmt20"

*% ------------------------------------------------------------ Paper
*% Names and sizes from the Windows GPD (EA6MDLTMT203.GPD / EA6RESTM.DLL).
*% 80 mm roll: 576-dot head from x = 10.80 pt; 58 mm roll: 420 dots from 7.09 pt.
*% Office sizes print reduced ("Unsupported Paper: Automatically adjust").
*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: RP80x297
*PageSize Letter/LT 8.5 x 11 in: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4 210 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Postcard/Postcard 100 x 148 mm: "<</PageSize[283.46 419.53]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize RP58x297/Roll Paper 58 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[164.41 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize RP58x3276/Roll Paper 58 x 3276 mm: "<</PageSize[164.41 9286.30]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize RP80x297/Roll Paper 80 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[226.77 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize RP80x3276/Roll Paper 80 x 3276 mm: "<</PageSize[226.77 9286.30]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize TrussTape/TRUSS TAPE 3.18 x 12 in: "<</PageSize[228.96 864]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*%@@UDP PageSize
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: RP80x297
*PageRegion Letter/LT 8.5 x 11 in: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4 210 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Postcard/Postcard 100 x 148 mm: "<</PageSize[283.46 419.53]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion RP58x297/Roll Paper 58 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[164.41 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion RP58x3276/Roll Paper 58 x 3276 mm: "<</PageSize[164.41 9286.30]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion RP80x297/Roll Paper 80 x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[226.77 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion RP80x3276/Roll Paper 80 x 3276 mm: "<</PageSize[226.77 9286.30]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion TrussTape/TRUSS TAPE 3.18 x 12 in: "<</PageSize[228.96 864]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*%@@UDP PageRegion
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: RP80x297
*ImageableArea Letter/LT 8.5 x 11 in: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea A4/A4 210 x 297 mm: "0 0 595.28 841.89"
*ImageableArea Postcard/Postcard 100 x 148 mm: "0 0 283.46 419.53"
*ImageableArea RP58x297/Roll Paper 58 x 297 mm: "7.09 0 156.06 841.89"
*ImageableArea RP58x3276/Roll Paper 58 x 3276 mm: "7.09 0 156.06 9286.30"
*ImageableArea RP80x297/Roll Paper 80 x 297 mm: "10.80 0 215.13 841.89"
*ImageableArea RP80x3276/Roll Paper 80 x 3276 mm: "10.80 0 215.13 9286.30"
*ImageableArea TrussTape/TRUSS TAPE 3.18 x 12 in: "0 0 228.96 864"
*%@@UDP ImageableArea

*DefaultPaperDimension: RP80x297
*PaperDimension Letter/LT 8.5 x 11 in: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4 210 x 297 mm: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension Postcard/Postcard 100 x 148 mm: "283.46 419.53"
*PaperDimension RP58x297/Roll Paper 58 x 297 mm: "164.41 841.89"
*PaperDimension RP58x3276/Roll Paper 58 x 3276 mm: "164.41 9286.30"
*PaperDimension RP80x297/Roll Paper 80 x 297 mm: "226.77 841.89"
*PaperDimension RP80x3276/Roll Paper 80 x 3276 mm: "226.77 9286.30"
*PaperDimension TrussTape/TRUSS TAPE 3.18 x 12 in: "228.96 864"
*%@@UDP PaperDimension

*% User defined size (GPD CUSTOMSIZE: MinLeftMargin 0, origin at the page edge).
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "595.28"
*MaxMediaHeight: "9286.30"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 149.10 595.28
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 72 9286.30
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% --------------------------------------------------- Paper/Quality
*OpenGroup: PaperQuality/Paper/Quality

*% "Paper Source" in the Windows driver = Epson paper conservation: blank
*% space at the top/bottom of each page is not fed.  Windows default: Bottom.
*% Here the default is None so tapes and labels come out at their exact length.
*OpenUI *TmPaperSource/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmPaperSource
*DefaultTmPaperSource: None
*TmPaperSource None/None: ""
*TmPaperSource Top/Top: ""
*TmPaperSource Bottom/Bottom: ""
*TmPaperSource Both/Top & Bottom: ""
*CloseUI: *TmPaperSource

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Mono
*ColorModel Mono/Monochrome: "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*CloseGroup: PaperQuality

*% -------------------------------------------------------- Advanced
*OpenGroup: Advanced/Advanced

*OpenUI *Resolution/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 x 203 dots per inch: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *TmHalftone/Halftoning: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmHalftone
*DefaultTmHalftone: Dither8x8
*TmHalftone Dither8x8/Dither 8x8: ""
*CloseUI: *TmHalftone

*OpenUI *TmPaperWidth/Roll paper width: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmPaperWidth
*DefaultTmPaperWidth: 80mm
*TmPaperWidth 80mm/80 mm: ""
*TmPaperWidth 58mm/58 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *TmPaperWidth

*OpenUI *TmScaling/Reduced size print: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmScaling
*DefaultTmScaling: 100
*TmScaling 100/100%: ""
*TmScaling 70/70%: ""
*CloseUI: *TmScaling

*OpenUI *TmUpsideDown/Upside-down: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmUpsideDown
*DefaultTmUpsideDown: False
*TmUpsideDown False/Disabled: ""
*TmUpsideDown True/Enabled: ""
*CloseUI: *TmUpsideDown

*CloseGroup: Advanced

*% ------------------------------------------------------- Feed and Cut
*OpenGroup: FeedCut/Feed and Cut

*OpenUI *TmFeedCut/Preset option: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmFeedCut
*DefaultTmFeedCut: DocFeedCut
*TmFeedCut DocFeedCut/Document[Feed, Cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut DocFeedNoCut/Document[Feed, No cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut DocNoFeedCut/Document[No feed, Cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut DocNoFeedNoCut/Document[No feed, No cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut PageFeedCut/Page[Feed, Cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut PageFeedNoCut/Page[Feed, No cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut PageNoFeedCut/Page[No feed, Cut]: ""
*TmFeedCut Detail/Custom: ""
*CloseUI: *TmFeedCut

*CloseGroup: FeedCut

*% ------------------------------------------------------ Peripherals
*OpenGroup: Peripherals/Peripherals

*OpenUI *TmPeripherals/Cash drawer and buzzer: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmPeripherals
*DefaultTmPeripherals: Default
*TmPeripherals Default/As set in Printing Preferences: ""
*TmPeripherals None/Nothing: ""
*CloseUI: *TmPeripherals

*CloseGroup: Peripherals

*% ------------------------------------- macOS additions (not on Windows)
*OpenGroup: MacOS/Calibration (macOS)

*OpenUI *TmLengthScale/Length calibration: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmLengthScale
*DefaultTmLengthScale: 1.000
*TmLengthScale 0.990/-1.0 %: ""
*TmLengthScale 0.995/-0.5 %: ""
*TmLengthScale 1.000/None: ""
*TmLengthScale 1.005/+0.5 %: ""
*TmLengthScale 1.010/+1.0 %: ""
*TmLengthScale 1.015/+1.5 %: ""
*TmLengthScale 1.020/+2.0 %: ""
*CloseUI: *TmLengthScale
*CustomTmLengthScale True/Custom: ""
*ParamCustomTmLengthScale Scale/Scale factor: 1 real 0.9 1.1

*OpenUI *TmBlankFeed/Blank space output: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmBlankFeed
*DefaultTmBlankFeed: Feed
*TmBlankFeed Feed/Paper feed (ESC J, like Epson driver): ""
*TmBlankFeed Raster/Blank raster (exact, slower): ""
*CloseUI: *TmBlankFeed

*OpenUI *TmCompress/Compress graphics: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmCompress
*DefaultTmCompress: True
*TmCompress True/Yes: ""
*TmCompress False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *TmCompress

*OpenUI *TmPrintControl/Print control mode (experimental): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TmPrintControl
*DefaultTmPrintControl: Default
*TmPrintControl Default/Printer setting: ""
*TmPrintControl Mode1/Mode 1: ""
*TmPrintControl Mode2/Mode 2: ""
*TmPrintControl Mode3/Mode 3: ""
*CloseUI: *TmPrintControl

*CloseGroup: MacOS

*% ---------------------------------------- Printing Preferences settings
*% Written by TMUtility.app; read by rastertotmt20 (job -o options win).
*%@@TMSETTINGS
*%@@TMUSERPAPER

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Bold: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Bold: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
